questions.question:
Let for $x \in \mathbb{R}$,


 f(x)=\frac{x+|x|}{2} \text { and } g(x)=\left\{\begin{array}{cc}
x, & x<0 \\
x^{2}, & x \geq 0
\end{array}\right. \text {. } 

Then area bounded by the curve $y=(f \circ g)(x)$ and the lines $y=0,2 y-x=15$ is equal to __________.

